195
00:09:22,960 --> 00:09:27,090
modeling, but they will
break down very, very easily.

196
00:09:27,090 --> 00:09:29,730
They'll break down
when these assumptions

197
00:09:29,730 --> 00:09:32,550
I gave you don't hold,
